## Out of scope (do not implement without product decision)

- Cloud relay, STUN/TURN, ADB, public tunnel (explicitly removed per AUDIT).
- Default **full** 8-tracker mode for unknown phone accuracy.
- GPU MediaPipe / DWPose as default on dual-phone CPU-bound PCs.
- Claiming measurement-grade triangulation without checkerboard lens + measured room layout.
